    you control leaves the field by card effect (except during the Damage Step):
    You can Special Summon 1 "R.B." monster from your Deck. You can only use this
    effect of "R.B. Funk Dock" once per turn. You can only activate 1 "R.B. Funk
    Dock" per turn.'
